- Copy ID.
- Borrower.
- Issue date.
- Due date.
- Days overdue, where applicable.
- Loan status.

Provide search, sorting, filtering, and detail navigation.

Use one consistent overdue calculation based on dates and loan status.

A returned book must not continue to appear as actively overdue. Exclude archived or otherwise ineligible records as appropriate.

