- Do not silently delete lost or damaged inventory records.
- Restore a copy to Available only when the appropriate workflow permits it.

If fines, replacement charges, or finance adjustments are involved, do not directly modify finance records unless the existing permission model allows it. Use an approved integration point instead.

### 6.12 Library transactions and reports

Maintain a transaction history for supported actions:

- Issue.
- Return.
- Reservation.
- Cancellation.
- Copy status change.
