Both workspaces must use the existing SCHLAR architecture.

- Reuse shared state, models, routing, and persistence.
- Reuse existing student and staff records.
- Avoid creating separate copies of students, staff, or vehicles for different screens.
- Ensure all supported changes update relevant lists, details, dashboards, and reports.
- Preserve relationships between book titles and physical copies.
