### DEFINITION OF DONE

The Librarian can manage authorized catalogue, inventory, issue, return, loan, and reporting workflows using consistent records.

The Transport Manager can manage authorized vehicles, drivers, routes, stops, student assignments, rosters, and supported maintenance workflows using consistent records.

Both workspaces must be professional, responsive, easy to navigate, permission-aware, and integrated with the existing SCHLAR application. Existing features must remain intact, and the implementation must not falsely claim real-world integrations.